    "faq": {
      "type": "faq-full",
      "blocks": {
        "q_experience": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need any experience?",
            "answer": "<p>None. The app walks you through every step, one thread at a time, like an audio paint by number. There's nothing to figure out on your own. The first step is the same for everyone and the result always wows.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_how_long": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take?",
            "answer": "<p>Most pieces take six to eight hours, depending on the line count- each 500 lines takes under an hour, and we recommend 3000-4000 lines. Pause whenever, you don't have to finish in one sitting. The app saves your place after every step, so you can take it easy at your own pace.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_lose_place": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I lose my place?",
            "answer": "<p>Mistakes do not matter at all, there is no need to go back.  Each missed step will get covered by the thousands of others.  Dozens and dozens go unnoticed. The app remembers exactly where you stopped, down to the last thread you confirmed. Step away for an hour or a week, then pick up right where you left off.  </p>"
          }
        },
        "q_any_photo": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use any photo?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Although, some photos work better than others- try many! Crisp portraits and close-ups with clear contrast tend to come out best - the app reads light and shadow rather than fine detail. A favorite person, a pet, a pastime that means something to you. Upload it, and your hands and the app do the rest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_pause": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I pause and come back to it?",
            "answer": "<p>Anytime. The app holds your progress automatically, so a Threaditate fits around your life. Some people finish in an afternoon. Others thread a little each evening over a week or few.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_missing": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if something is missing from my kit?",
            "answer": "<p>We'll make it right. Reach out through our <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact page</a> with your order number and what's missing, and we'll send a replacement. We are a small family business and making this artform easy is important to us.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
